### Upload PDF
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ApplyLensBoundary
Cookie: applylens_session=YOUR_SESSION_TOKEN

--ApplyLensBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="internship-notice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./1.pdf
--ApplyLensBoundary--
